B.bQF=new A.vj("The outlet by the sofa does not work, but the lights do.","The tester finds power at the box but the outlet is dead: a screw on the outlet has come loose. Turn the breaker off first, then tighten the screws with the screwdriver.","screwdriver","You tightened the loose screw. The outlet works again.",81,72,"Turn the living room breaker OFF first.")
