B.bQJ=new A.vj("The kitchen outlets are dead.","The GFCI outlet has tripped. Press its RESET button by hand.","hand","You pressed RESET. The kitchen outlets work.",84,0,"")
B.bQE=new A.vj("The toilet keeps running.","The rubber flapper in the tank no longer seals, so water leaks into the bowl all the time. Replace the flapper.","flapper","New flapper fitted. The toilet stops running.",88,0,"")
B.bQH=new A.vj("The kitchen faucet drips.","The faucet washer is worn. Tighten the packing nut with the wrench, then check.","wrench","The faucet is sealed. No more drips.",85,0,"")
